            "review_title": "Review at Ish - The Indian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mery\n72 contributions\n0\nPoor Customer Service\nJan 2026 • Solo\nOrdered butter chicken, garlic naan, and chicken biryani. Food was delicious.\n\nNo one came to check if I was ready to order. I waited a while and stood up to flag someone. No one came to provide me with the bill, I had to get up and go to the front to pay. The white couple next to me had great service.\n\nIt's a nice restaurant right in front of dragon bridge.\n\nI would not return because of the service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 2, 2026",
